# Raw primary-source evidence captures must be preserved byte-for-byte.
# Without this, the repo's core.autocrlf=true setting silently normalizes
# line endings on add/checkout, causing the committed blob (and any future
# checkout) to diverge from the SHA-256 values recorded in MANIFEST.md.
*.html -text -diff binary
*.pdf -text -diff binary
*.json -text -diff binary
